<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10763] MVCC: Transaction already completed error in some tests</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10763</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&#160;&quot;Transaction is already completed&quot; error occurs time to time in some tests. Reproducer:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;CacheMvccReplicatedSqlTxQueriesTest.testReplicatedAndPartitionedUpdateSingleTransaction&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
