                            <comment id="16730113" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 28 Dec 2018 08:32:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It seems that error in &lt;tt&gt;CacheMvccReplicatedSqlTxQueriesTest.testReplicatedAndPartitionedUpdateSingleTransaction&lt;/tt&gt; is caused by leaked tx stored in &lt;tt&gt;ThreadLocal&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxManager.txContext&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
